WEBVTT

00:05:29.579 --> 00:05:31.962
None of us would have asked
for the climate crisis

00:05:31.986 --> 00:05:35.206
to have been put on our doorstep,
but it is; it's here.

00:05:35.230 --> 00:05:37.963
This is our historical reality.

00:05:38.510 --> 00:05:41.076
And we have a choice to make.

00:05:41.100 --> 00:05:42.596
Our destiny is to decide

00:05:42.620 --> 00:05:46.416
whether we're going to
respond to the climate crisis

00:05:46.440 --> 00:05:49.483
or whether we're going to
pretend that it's not happening,

00:05:49.507 --> 00:05:50.678
deny it.

00:05:50.702 --> 00:05:53.326
I think this is our moment of destiny,

00:05:53.350 --> 00:05:57.386
and I hope you'll decide to take part,

00:05:57.410 --> 00:06:00.013
to fight against the climate crisis,